  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "dot11decrypt: explicitly cast *pmk_len and msk_len",
  "description": "In a typical setting where int is 32 bits and the type guint8 is 8 bits, the overflow check in Dot11DecryptDerivePmkFromMsk will automatically promote the sum of msk_len and *pmk_len to an int. Since int is 32 bits and guint8 will always be 8 bits, the sum will never overflow. Therefore, an explicit casting of the sum of msk_len and *pmk_len to the type guint8 is necessary.",
  "state": "merged",
